    "id": 15459315220665,
    "title": "Zavelyn Drum™ Pro (15-Tone Steel Tongue Handpan Drum)",
    "body_html": "\n      <h2>The Master Instrument for Harmonic Sound Healing &amp; Musical Expression</h2>\n      <p>The <strong>Zavelyn Drum™ Pro</strong> is our flagship 15-tone handcrafted steel tongue handpan drum. Tuned with surgical precision to the healing frequency of <strong>432 Hz</strong> in D-Major, it offers an expansive two-octave musical range that allows you to play virtually any song, create meditative soundscapes, or effortlessly unwind after a long day.</p>\n      <h3>Why the Zavelyn Drum™ Pro is Extraordinary:</h3>\n      <ul>\n        <li>\n<strong>15 Harmonic Notes:</strong> Full chromatic-extended D-Major scale covering deep bass undertones, warm mid-ranges, and crystal-clear high resonances.</li>\n        <li>\n<strong>432 Hz Natural Frequency:</strong> Scientifically recognized to induce alpha brainwave states, promoting cellular relaxation, anxiety relief, and deep focus.</li>\n        <li>\n<strong>Premium Alloy Steel Craftsmanship:</strong> Hand-cut and electroplated against tarnishing, scratches, and humidity for lifelong tonal stability.</li>\n        <li>\n<strong>Zero Experience Required:</strong> Numbered note system and intuitive harmonic layout make it impossible to hit a discordant note.</li>\n      </ul>\n      <h3>What's Included in Your Pro Bundle:</h3>\n      <ul>\n        <li>1x Zavelyn Drum™ Pro (15-Tone, 14-Inch Diameter)</li>\n        <li>1x Heavy-Duty Padded Travel Backpack with Dual Shoulder Straps</li>\n        <li>1x Pair of Solid Bamboo Mallets with Weighted Rubber Heads</li>\n        <li>1x Comprehensive Master Songbook &amp; Tutorial Guide (Numbered Notation)</li>\n        <li>4x Ergonomic Silicone Finger Picks</li>\n        <li>1x Set of High-Visibility Gold Note Decals</li>\n      </ul>\n    ",
